  unitName: Goddess Geirdriful (EU)
  unitId: 760115
  unitNumber: 7037
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Geirdriful, in a moment of
    insanity, has drunk Skalmold's blood on the day she has been slayed. The heroes
    came back and killed her too. But is a goddess of the dark art so easy to slay?
    People dream of mad crows searching for strange flames...
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: My crows will feast tonight.
  evoDesc: Crows and Death! Crows and death! More souls to bring to heavens... Did
    you meet my sister?
